# DbConn.connect — create_engine argument

In `DbConn.connect`, the call MUST be:

    self.engine = create_engine(self.c_string, **engine_kwargs)

Do NOT pass `engine_c_string`, `str(url)`, or any URL rendered from SQLAlchemy.
`_c_string_for_log` exists only for logging; it must not be used for `create_engine`.

Enforced by `TestDbConnConnectCString` in `exdrf_al_tests/connection_test.py`.
